OL,3,APM Andy Burnham proposes national care
OL,4,Aservice in England to tackle
OL,5,A'threadbare' social care system
OL,6,
OL,7,FAndy Burnham is proposing a national
OL,8,Fcare service for England to tackle the
OL,9,F"threadbare" social care service
OL,11,FHe tells Laura Kuenssberg "broken
OL,12,Fsocial care will in the end break the
OL,13,FNHS", adding that he'll put a care
OL,14,Fsystem that is free at the point of use
OL,15,Fon the ballot at the next general
OL,16,Felection
OL,18,FBut shadow home secretary Chris Philp
OL,19,Fwarns that 'more tax rises' are likely
OL,20,Fplanned to fund the scheme, which is a
OL,21,F'red line' for the Conservatives
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
